msgstr "`Capability::new` はアクセスモードを検査しません。検査するのは `validate` です。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:77
msgid "`owned_buffer_capability`, `shared_read_view_capability`, `atomic_cell_capability`, `mutex_capability`, `condvar_capability`, `rwlock_capability`, `semaphore_capability`, `barrier_capability`, `channel_capability` and `opaque_capability`"
msgstr "`owned_buffer_capability`、`shared_read_view_capability`、`atomic_cell_capability`、`mutex_capability`、`condvar_capability`、`rwlock_capability`、`semaphore_capability`、`barrier_capability`、`channel_capability`、`opaque_capability`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:79
msgid "Return the capability kinds of the same names."
msgstr "同名のケイパビリティの種類を返します。"

